id: wrathful-mind-over-monkey
name: Mind over Monkey
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
description: >
  Your conscious mind emerges over the beast inside, taking control to direct your wrath.
text: >
  Mind over Monkey: Your conscious mind emerges over the beast inside, taking control to direct your wrath.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Reduce the Rampaging Aspect for this Transformation by 1 level.
  (2)-[Permanent]: Wrathful loses the Innate State (Feral) Aspect.
  (3)-[1/Round]: You may use the Direct Hit option of the Defend Maneuver without spending a Counter Action.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you would use the Direct Hit option of the Defend Maneuver, instead of increasing your Soak Value by 1/2 – double it.

